1
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,900
- Where are we?
- Boston Harbor.

2
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,300
<i>Pull yourself together, Teddy.</i>

3
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,000
Yeah.

4
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,500
I never had any children.

5
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:09,200
Your daughter, her name was Rachel.

6
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:13,000
You will never leave this island alive.

7
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:16,000
Not you. Not your partner.

8
01:42:10,000 --> 01:42:14,000
Which would be worse? To live as a monster,

9
01:42:14,200 --> 01:42:17,500
or to die as a good man?
